---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <section class="page-hero">
        <h1>The Ultimate Sport for the Mind</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            The FIRST Robotics Competition (FRC) challenges secondary school students to design, build, and program industrial-level robots under strict engineering constraints[cite: 1].
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="the-challenge" class="content-section solid-bg">
        <h2>The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="large-text">
            Operating under an intense multi-week window, students are tasked with raising funds, designing a team brand, honing teamwork skills, and building and programming a 50 kg competitive robot[cite: 1]. 
        </p>
        <p class="large-text mt-1">
            It is as close to real-world engineering and business management as a student can get before university.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="timeline" class="content-section">
        <h2>The Annual Cycle</h2>
        <div class="timeline-grid">
            
            <!-- Phase 1 -->
            <div class="timeline-card">
                <div class="phase-header">
                    <span class="phase-num">01</span>
                    <h3>The Kickoff (January)</h3>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Every January, a brand-new game and strict rule manual are released globally via broadcast. Teams have zero prior knowledge of the challenge and must immediately begin strategic analysis and prototyping.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Phase 2 -->
            <div class="timeline-card">
                <div class="phase-header">
                    <span class="phase-num">02</span>
                    <h3>Build Season (Jan - March)</h3>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Teams meet aggressively—often 20 to 30 hours per week. In this window, students must finalize 3D CAD designs, machine custom parts, wire electrical systems, and write real-time control software to complete a battle-ready machine[cite: 1].
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Phase 3 -->
            <div class="timeline-card">
                <div class="phase-header">
                    <span class="phase-num">03</span>
                    <h3>Competitions (March - April)</h3>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Teams travel to multi-day regional arena events. Working in randomized alliances of three, robots compete on a basketball-court-sized field. Teams repair damages in the pit and optimize software on the fly to qualify for the World Championship.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    /* Reuse Hero Styles */
    .page-hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 4rem 1rem 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .page-hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
        color: var(--white);
    }

    .subtitle {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 1rem auto 0 auto;
    }

    .content-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .solid-bg {
        background-color: var(--card-bg);
        padding: 3rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .large-text {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    
    .mt-1 { margin-top: 1rem; }

    /* Timeline Grid */
    .timeline-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .timeline-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
    }

    .timeline-card {
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border-top: 3px solid var(--cornflower);
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
    }

    .phase-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .phase-num {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .timeline-card h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--white);
    }

    .timeline-card p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
</style>